{
//Mail
"FC.UGTC.Mail.Title": "Ultimate Guide To Clowning!",
"FC.UGTC.Mail": "Yaluu! Thank you for installing the Ultimate Guide To Clowning guidebook. Please note, that if you've installed this mod on it's own it won't do much for your gaming experience. You'll need to install one of my other mods.^But here's a guidebook on all my mods!",

//Objects
"FC.UGTC": "Ultimate Guide To Clowning",
"FC.UGTC.Desc": "Break the 4th wall with this limited edition guidebook!",
"FC.Category.Book": "Informational Reading.",

//Titles
"FC.TOC": "Table of Contents",
"FC.Characters.Title": "Characters",
"FC.Foods.Title": "Foods",
"FC.AAR.Title": "Animals",
"FC.ACE.Title":"Crops",
"FC.Artisans.Title": "Artisans",
"FC.Crafting.Title": "Crafting",
"FC.Buildings.Title": "Buildings",
"FC.AnimalProduce.Title": "Animal Produce",
//UGTC
"FC.UGTC.Page.00": "Yaluu and goodtimezone! As a heads up, if you have downloaded this mod without any of my other mods, then it will do nothing for your game. This is a guide book that will add more information depending on which of my mods you have installed. This mod is is a requirement for all my mods and there is a good reason why, not only is this a fourth wall guidebook to assist you when playing with my mods. But it also contains all my tilesheets that I will use between all my mods. The requirement for this mod will not change.",
"FC.UGTC.Page.01": "You will need to grind to a level four farming skill in order to get the hotline in the mail. I have made it a hotline for easy access, every season the seeds will change so be sure to check every season for something new. Each new crop as a large crop varient that will appear in 2 by 2 tills.",
"FC.UGTC.Page.02": "Also be perpared to grind your farming skills to level six in order to unlock the animals in Marnie's shop. You will get a letter from Marnie once you reach level six farming and then you will be able to buy the animals from her shop.",
"FC.UGTC.Page.03": "If you have installed any of my npc mods, this guide will help you navigate befriending the characters. The information will change whenever I update my characters stories, so check that guide every update.",
"FC.UGTC.Page.04": "I would to thank my friends and the community of this lovely game for the support, encouragement and feedback. I look forward to creating more content for everyone to enjoy. For now, be happy and stay shapely my friends.",

