"FC.ACE.JoluuSpearouus.Page.00": "Coriuma Sericea: Joluu Spearouus",
"FC.ACE.JoluuSpearouus.Page.01": "Season: Spring",
"FC.ACE.JoluuSpearouus.Page.02": "Growth: 6 Days",
"FC.ACE.JoluuSpearouus.Page.03": "Lore: A joluu spearouus fruit has an interesting texture. The skin is of the fruit is leathery and very tough, but the inside is watery and silky. It's taste is also subtly sweet.",

"FC.ACE.LunonareFlower.Page.00": "Lunaria Serica: Lunonare Flower",
"FC.ACE.LunonareFlower.Page.01": "Season: Summer",
"FC.ACE.LunonareFlower.Page.02": "Growth: 5 Days",
"FC.ACE.LunonareFlower.Page.03": "Lore: While similar to the carnivorous lunonare death flower; the lunonare silk flower is instead known for it's edible and silky soft petals.",

"FC.ACE.PyrrhusBerry.Page.00": "Capsicumorbus Dulcis: Pyrrhus Berry",
"FC.ACE.PyrrhusBerry.Page.01": "Season: Summer",
"FC.ACE.PyrrhusBerry.Page.02": "Growth: 7 Days",
"FC.ACE.PyrrhusBerry.Page.03": "Lore: While techincally a fruit, the pyrrhus berry taste similar to a sweeten ghost pepper.",

"FC.ACE.Topachu.Page.00": "Cucurbita Dulcisimel: Topachu",
"FC.ACE.Topachu.Page.01": "Season: Winter",
"FC.ACE.Topachu.Page.02": "Growth: 5 Days",
"FC.ACE.Topachu.Page.03": "Lore: Topacho is type of gourd that has a taste similar to sweet potatoes and honey.",

"FC.ACE.Seage.Page.00": "Melofragaria Ananas: Seage Fruit",
"FC.ACE.Seage.Page.01": "Season: Spring",
"FC.ACE.Seage.Page.02": "Growth: 6 Days",
"FC.ACE.Seage.Page.03": "Lore: Seage fruit is a type of melon that a taste similar to pineapple mixed with strawberries.",

"FC.ACE.MuuaiFlower.Page.00": "Saccharipetalum Pubescens: Muuai Flower",
"FC.ACE.MuuaiFlower.Page.01": "Season: Summer",
"FC.ACE.MuuaiFlower.Page.02": "Growth: 9 Days",
"FC.ACE.MuuaiFlower.Page.03": "Lore: The muuai flower tastes sweet like cotton candy and tangy like grape fruit it also has fuzzy petals.",

"FC.ACE.Mandkin.Page.00": "Cucurbita Caerulifeta: Mandkin",
"FC.ACE.Mandkin.Page.01": "Season: Fall",
"FC.ACE.Mandkin.Page.02": "Growth: 7 Days",
"FC.ACE.Mandkin.Page.03": "Lore: The mandkin is apart of the squash family, but taste like blueberries dizzled with feta cheese.",

"FC.ACE.Puuffan.Page.00": "Fructiflorus Caseus: Puuffan",
"FC.ACE.Puuffan.Page.01": "Season: Winter",
"FC.ACE.Puuffan.Page.02": "Growth: 6 days",
"FC.ACE.Puuffan.Page.03": "Lore: The Puufan plant is techincally a flower, but it's meatier and cheesy taste caused the Arcanian people to label it a crop.",

"FC.ACE.WhoruuFlower.Page.00": "Suisflora Melliglutinosa: Whoruu Flower",
"FC.ACE.WhoruuFlower.Page.01": "Season: Spring",
"FC.ACE.WhoruuFlower.Page.02": "Growth: 7 Days",
"FC.ACE.WhoruuFlower.Page.03": "Lore: The whoruu flower has a flavor similar to honey glazed ham.",

"FC.ACE.GruutehRoot.Page.00": "Dulcisradix Gruutehensis: Gruuteh Root",
"FC.ACE.GruutehRoot.Page.01": "Season: Fall",
"FC.ACE.GruutehRoot.Page.02": "Growth: 7 Days",
"FC.ACE.GruutehRoot.Page.03": "Lore: Gruuteh root is typically used as a sugar cane replacement.",

"FC.ACE.DragaClawtus.Page.00": "Carnisucus Dulcis: Draga Clawtus",
"FC.ACE.DragaClawtus.Page.01": "Season: Fall",
"FC.ACE.DragaClawtus.Page.02": "Growth: 7 Days",
"FC.ACE.DragaClawtus.Page.03": "Lore: Draga Clawtus can be used to sweeten foods or eaten alone as a expensive treat. It's also a carnivorous plant.",

"FC.ACE.DarkTuuph.Page.00": "Brassicaraphanus Gustus: Dark Tuuph",
"FC.ACE.DarkTuuph.Page.01": "Season: Spring",
"FC.ACE.DarkTuuph.Page.02": "Growth: 5 Days",
"FC.ACE.DarkTuuph.Page.03": "Lore: Dark Tuuph taste like cabbage and raddishes.",

"FC.ACE.DragaTonguula.Page.00": "Persipronus Pungens: Draga Tonguula",
"FC.ACE.DragaTonguula.Page.01": "Season:Summer",
"FC.ACE.DragaTonguula.Page.02": "Growth: 8 Days",
"FC.ACE.DragaTonguula.Page.03": "Lore: Draga Tonguula has a flavor similar to peaches mixed with jalapeno juice.",

"FC.ACE.AdauulaStalk.Page.00": "Zeamollis Anacardium: Adauula Stalk",
"FC.ACE.AdauulaStalk.Page.01": "Season: Spring",
"FC.ACE.AdauulaStalk.Page.02": "Growth: 5 days",
"FC.ACE.AdauulaStalk.Page.03": "Lore: Adauula taste similar to corn mill, but it has a cashew like aftertaste. It's also fluffy!",

"FC.ACE.GaggleShroom.Page.00": "Psychopyra Amarissima: Gaggle Shroom",
"FC.ACE.GaggleShroom.Page.01": "Season: Fall",
"FC.ACE.GaggleShroom.Page.02": "Growth: 5 Days",
"FC.ACE.GaggleShroom.Page.03": "Lore:Gaggle shrooms are very bitter with a spicy bite and can cause pychosis when eaten raw, it's also used for medications when the toxins are boiled away.",

"FC.ACE.WarpRoot.Page.00": "Contortaradix Amarus: Warp Root",
"FC.ACE.WarpRoot.Page.01": "Season: Winter",
"FC.ACE.WarpRoot.Page.02": "Growth: 5 Days",
"FC.ACE.WarpRoot.Page.03": "Lore: Warp root is bitter like dark chocolate, but has no sweetness to it.",

"FC.ACE.StoneFlower.Page.00": "Saxifraga Toxicafeum: Stone Flower",
"FC.ACE.StoneFlower.Page.01": "Season: Fall",
"FC.ACE.StoneFlower.Page.02": "Growth: 5 Days",
"FC.ACE.StoneFlower.Page.03": "Lore: The petals and the stalk of the stone flower can be boiled to make a coffee replacement. It shouldn't be eaten raw though, as it is slightly toxic to humans as well as cats.",

"FC.ACE.VoidTreeFruit.Page.00": "Lactiflua Obscura: Void Tree Fruit",
"FC.ACE.VoidTreeFruit.Page.01": "Season: Winter",
"FC.ACE.VoidTreeFruit.Page.02": "Growth: 8 Days",
"FC.ACE.VoidTreeFruit.Page.03": "Lore: The void fruit taste like regular while milk, it's used a dairy replacement in Arcania.",

"FC.ACE.TropaTree.Page.00": "Arborcontorta Niveifructus: Tropa Tree",
"FC.ACE.TropaTree.Page.01": "Season: Winter",
"FC.ACE.TropaTree.Page.02": "Lore: The tropa tree is culuturally important to the Arcanian people. They beleive that a forest spirit called the zoot is grown from it's root. The fruit is also fuzzy to the touch and has a tangy taste similar to prunes.",

"FC.ACE.ReuuTree.Page.00": "Oxygenodendron Reuii: Reuu Tree",
"FC.ACE.ReuuTree.Page.01": "Season: Fall",
"FC.ACE.ReuuTree.Page.02": "Lore: The reuu tree release massive amounts of oxygen into the atmostsphere and until recently was thought to be extinct.",

"FC.ACE.HeaviousTree.Page.00": "Ginkgo Persistens: Heavious Tree",
"FC.ACE.HeaviousTree.Page.01": "Season: Winter",
"FC.ACE.HeaviousTree.Page.02": "Lore: The heavious tree is techincally a ginko tree, it managed to survive the jurrasic period all the way to modern times.",

"FC.ACE.BuurkTree.Page.00": "Arborfusca Triphora: Buurk Tree",
"FC.ACE.BuurkTree.Page.01": "Season: Spring",
"FC.ACE.BuurkTree.Page.02": "Lore: The buurk tree is a invasive tree species from the east, however the enviroment of Arcania benefited from it's introduction.",

"FC.ACE.MeekTree.Page.00": "Dendrotropis Ternifructus: Meek Tree",
"FC.ACE.MeekTree.Page.01": "Season: Spring",
"FC.ACE.MeekTree.Page.02": "Lore: The meek tree got it's name from a bontist named Meeka Lyrah. She developed the tree species by crossing a tropa tree with a burrk tree.",

"FC.ACE.CarnivorousTree.Page.00": "Mortivora Cadaveris Arcanicus: Mortivore Tree",
"FC.ACE.CarnivorousTree.Page.01": "Season: Winter",
"FC.ACE.CarnivorousTree.Page.02": "Lore: The Wild Mortivore Tree is the original form of the Mortivore Fruit Tree, naturally developed from the Tropa Tree in regions with soils poor in plant nutrients and high in decomposing animal matter. This tree obtains most of its sustenance from animal proteins present in the environment.",

"FC.ACE.FireSnapper.Page.00": "Ignismordere Florere: Fire Snapper",
"FC.ACE.FireSnapper.Page.01": "Season: Summer",
"FC.ACE.FireSnapper.Page.02": "Lore: The fire snapper is a fly trap flower that is used for pain releif and flavoring. This particular plant has a spicy taste that Arcanian people love.",

"FC.ACE.StoneShroom.Page.00": "Lapisano Fungorum: Stone Shroom",
"FC.ACE.StoneShroom.Page.01": "Season: Fall",
"FC.ACE.StoneShroom.Page.02": "Lore: The stone shroom is a popular addition in salads, as it is fortifide with multiple vitamins. It has a earthy taste and is know for giving dishes a much needed crunch.",

"FC.ACE.HeaviousRoot.Page.00": "Gretorta Radicata: Heavious Root",
"FC.ACE.HeaviousRoot.Page.01": "Season: Spring",
"FC.ACE.HeaviousRoot.Page.02": "Lore: A heavous root, is techincally a root from the Heavious tree that has surfaced and started to grow above ground. The Arcanian people enjoy this root fried or in soups.",

"FC.ACE.DragaTail.Page.00": "Dracodauda Flora: Draga Tail",
"FC.ACE.DragaTail.Page.01": "Season: Any season | After Storms",
"FC.ACE.DragaTail.Page.02": "Lore: The draga tail is rare sea fruit, that usually washes ashore after a storm. It's used in a few pricy dishes.",

"FC.ACE.FairyFingers.Page.00": "Magialangous: Fairy Fingers",
"FC.ACE.FairyFingers.Page.01": "Season: Winter",
"FC.ACE.FairyFingers.Page.02": "Lore: The fariy finger plant is not actually made from fairies...It's just the name, the Arcanian people enjoy this during festival celebrations usually fried.",

"FC.ACE.DragaEye.Page.00": "Draquae Oculos: Draga Eye",
"FC.ACE.DragaEye.Page.01": "Season: Any season | After Green Rain",
"FC.ACE.DragaEye.Page.02": "Lore: ONe of the rarest peices of fruits you can forage, you can find it after a green rain event. ",

"FC.ACE.SpiritBud.Page.00": "Spiritus Florere: Spirit Bud",
"FC.ACE.SpiritBud.Page.01": "Season: Any Season",
"FC.ACE.SpiritBud.Page.02": "Lore: THe people of Arcanian beleive that this flower grows wherever spirits walk in the land of the living.",

//Foods
"FC.ACE.SweetJoluuSwirl.Page.00": "Sweet Joluu Swirl",
"FC.ACE.SweetJoluuSwirl.Page.01": "Lore:  Often served at parties, holiday gatherings and special occasions.",

"FC.ACE.SpicyGulperPlatter.Page.00": "Spicy Gulper Platter",
"FC.ACE.SpicyGulperPlatter.Page.01": "Lore:  This spicy dish was originally a poor man's food that turned posh. ",

"FC.ACE.FriedIficusFish.Page.00": "Fried Ificus Fish",
"FC.ACE.FriedIficusFish.Page.01": "Lore: Fried Ificus Fish  was originally served at temples as a staple for a source of protein.",

"FC.ACE.SpicyGraveBuster.Page.00": "Spicy Grave Crab",
"FC.ACE.SpicyGraveBuster.Page.01": "Lore: This dish is controversial to eat and expensive.",

"FC.ACE.FriedJellyfish.Page.00": "Fried Jellyfish",
"FC.ACE.FriedJellyfish.Page.01": "Lore: Riverbed Jellyfish have lost their sting and their friend tentacles has become a popular snack among Arcanians.",

"FC.ACE.SpicyFriedDancerFish.Page.00": "Spicy Fried Dancer Fish",
"FC.ACE.SpicyFriedDancerFish.Page.01": "Lore: Rating high on the spice scale, this fried dancer fish dish is commonly paired with a cold glass of Galebison milk.",

"FC.ACE.WhoruuFlowerCake.Page.00": "Whoruu Flower Cake",
"FC.ACE.WhoruuFlowerCake.Page.01": "Lore: While made with natrual sweeteners and plants, the Whoruu flower cake is considered the most unhealthy dessert you could eat. It's sweet flavor is described as rich and overly saturated.",

"FC.ACE.BloodSoup.Page.00": "Blood Soup",
"FC.ACE.BloodSoup.Page.01": "Lore: Made with the Leechie fish, this blood based soup is pack with protein and probiotics. It's commonly used to treat stomach illness and is a good way to introduce new gut Bacteria to your body after high doses of antibiotics.",

"FC.ACE.CheesyTopachuStew.Page.00": "Cheesy Topachu Stew",
"FC.ACE.CheesyTopachuStew.Page.01": "Lore: Savory, cheesy and thick this hardy dish is popular among the lower class citizen's of Arcania. The Topachu taste similar to sweet potatoes and the cheese is made from fresh Galebison milk.",

"FC.ACE.CreamPuffanPie.Page.00": "Cream Puffan Pie",
"FC.ACE.CreamPuffanPie.Page.01": "Lore: Savory and sweet, this pie is one of the healthier alternatives to enjoyng desserts.",

"FC.ACE.ReuuNutPudding.Page.00": "Reuu Nut Pudding",
"FC.ACE.ReuuNutPudding.Page.01": "Lore: Nutty in flavor, this pudding is mixed with purée Joluu Spearouus to give it a natrual and subtle sweetness.",

"FC.ACE.SweetBreadTwist.Page.00": "Sweet Bread Twist",
"FC.ACE.SweetBreadTwist.Page.01": "Lore: Sweetened with gruuteh root, this adauula bread is usually given as a way to start a romantic reltionship with someone in Arcania.",

"FC.ACE.StuffedTuuphRoll.Page.00": "Stuffed Tuuph Roll",
"FC.ACE.StuffedTuuphRoll.Page.01": "Lore: Savory and packed with nuritrents, this stuffed pocket of adauula bread was originally made to feed fisher class of Arcania. Due to it's easy to carry shape and great taste it became a popular fast food.",

"FC.ACE.AdauulaCake.Page.00": "Adauula Cakes",
"FC.ACE.AdauulaCake.Page.01": "Lore: While similar to pancakes, this dish was popularized during the bronze age of Arcania. It was commonly made in the morning, and it's nutty cakes was enjoyed with gruuteh syrup or pyrrhus berry sauce.",

"FC.ACE.MandkinPuff.Page.00": "Mandkin Puff",
"FC.ACE.MandkinPuff.Page.01": "Lore: Cheesy in flavor, this dish was popular among the high classes of Arcania due to it's use of the puffian flower and tropa wine.",

"FC.ACE.GaggleShroomTea.Page.00": "Gaggle Shroom Tea",
"FC.ACE.GaggleShroomTea.Page.01": "Lore: While bitter, this drink is enjoyed as a tea that not only numbs a sore throat but can also ease aches and pains in the rest of the body.",

"FC.ACE.LuunoSoup.Page.00": "Luuno Soup",
"FC.ACE.LuunoSoup.Page.01": "Lore: Originally, this dish was made by a well known and beloved homeless woman. Who managed to combine the nontoxic parts of the Luunonare flower with Galebison milk; this dish nuritrent rich soup was perfect at keeping people healthy during times of food insecurity.",

"FC.ACE.SourClawtusBread.Page.00": "Sour Clawtus Bread",
"FC.ACE.SourClawtusBread.Page.01": "Lore: With a sour aftertaste and the use of the expensive Clawtus fruit, this bread is used in high end recipes and served usually to those of higher status.",

"FC.ACE.WarpRootTea.Page.00": "Warp Root Tea",
"FC.ACE.WarpRootTea.Page.01": "Lore: Sweetened with gruuteh root, this usually bitter tea is a staple for many Arcanian homes.And is even used in tea ritiuals.",

"FC.ACE.IceyGruutehCream.Page.00": "Icey Gruuteh Cream",
"FC.ACE.IceyGruutehCream.Page.01": "Lore: Sweet gruuteh root milked with Galebison milk, this dessert is popular among children and adults.",

"FC.ACE.MuuaiPetalTea.Page.00": "Muuai Petal Tea",
"FC.ACE.MuuaiPetalTea.Page.01": "Lore:One of the only instances of natrually sweet tea, this beverage is usually paired with a savory dish to compliment it's candy like flavor.",

"FC.ACE.SpicyRaphusScramble.Page.00": "Spicy Raphus Scramble",
"FC.ACE.SpicyRaphusScramble.Page.01": "Lore: With eggs that are packed with nuritrents and thicker then the average hen. This Raphus scrable is spiced up with pyrrhus berry sauce and usually served as a breakfast dish,",

"FC.ACE.DeaEggHash.Page.00": "Dea Egg Hash",
"FC.ACE.DeaEggHash.Page.01": "Lore: Controversial due to the dark legends behind the Dea bird, this overwhelmingly flavoriful dish isn't popular but it is nutritious.",

"FC.ACE.StonePetalCoffee.Page.00": "Stone Petal Coffee",
"FC.ACE.StonePetalCoffee.Page.01": "Lore: The perfect replacement for the bitter coffee bean, this morning beverage can be served hot or cold and has a natrual sweetness to it.",

"FC.ACE.SpicyRaptorEggs.Page.00": "Spicy Raptor Eggs",
"FC.ACE.SpicyRaptorEggs.Page.01": "Lore: With movoraptors being the most common bird to rear, this breakfood is common, beloved and easier to get a hold of.",

"FC.ACE.BuurkFruitPudding.Page.00": "Buurk Fruit Pudding",
"FC.ACE.BuurkFruitPudding.Page.01": "Lore: Natrually sweet and easy to get a hold of. Burrk pudding has been a popular dessert among all the citizen's of Arcania since the bronze age.",

"FC.ACE.CandiedHeaviousFruit.Page.00": "Candied Heavious Fruit",
"FC.ACE.CandiedHeaviousFruit.Page.01": "Lore: This candied treat is popular among children due to it's overwhelming use of gruuteh sap.",

"FC.ACE.CandiedMeekFruit.Page.00": "Candied Meek Fruit",
"FC.ACE.CandiedMeekFruit.Page.01": "Lore: This candied treat is popular among adult due to it's sweet coating and sour after tase.",

"FC.ACE.LavaPop.Page.00": "Lava Pop",
"FC.ACE.LavaPop.Page.01": "Lore: Made by coating pyrrhus berry in a gruuteh mixture, this spicy candy can clear even the stuffiest of noses.",

"FC.ACE.BreakfastPizza.Page.00": "Breakfast Pizza",
"FC.ACE.BreakfastPizza.Page.01": "Lore: Based on the traditional pizza, this is a Arcanian spin on a beloved meal.",

"FC.ACE.VoidFruitIceCream.Page.00": "Void Fruit Ice Cream",
"FC.ACE.VoidFruitIceCream.Page.01": "Lore: Sweetened with seage and void fruit, this icecream taste of just sweetened milk.",

